{{!-- The Read column on the party stash (a Group actor's inventory), Party Stash's Take
      column's shape. `always-interactive` is required, not decorative: on a sheet the viewer
      cannot edit, the framework disables every control without the class; what the button does
      is re-validated in the handler. dnd5e renders a column partial with the column object as
      its context and the row's item as `item`. --}}
<div class="item-detail item-clueboardRead" data-column-id="clueboardRead">
    <button type="button" class="clueboard-read-button always-interactive"
            aria-label="{{ localize "fvtt-mod-clueboard.read.ariaLabel" name=item.name }}">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open" inert></i>
        <span>{{ localize "fvtt-mod-clueboard.read.button" }}</span>
    </button>
</div>
